  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig. 1, ‘Timeline for HWF information strengthening – initiatives, resolutions and publications’. A horizontal timeline spanning 2004 to 2023 with milestone callouts above and below the axis: 2004 (Joint Learning Initiative report published); 2006 (World health report 2006 published; Global health workforce statistics database established); 2009 (Handbook on monitoring and evaluation of human resources for health published); 2010 (WHO Global Code of Practice on the International Recruitment of Health Personnel, WHA63.16); 2013 (Recife report ‘A universal truth: no health without a health workforce’ published); 2016 (Final report of the expert group to the High-Level Commission on Health Employment and Economic Growth published; Global Strategy on Human Resources for Health: Workforce 2030, WHA69.19); 2017 (NHWA handbook published; NHWA data platform launched); 2018 (NHWA implementation guide published); 2020 (NHWA data portal launched); 2022 (Handbook on strengthening health workforce collection, analysis and use published); and 2023 (NHWA handbook second edition published).",
      "lang": "en",
